        },
        {
          "gap": "Independent contemporaneous corroboration of the leaked circular and the retaliation chain remains thinner than the surrounding reporting.",
          "lenses": ["7B.6", "7B.7", "7B.10"],
          "best_source_or_query_direction": "Authenticated document images, court exhibits, or official investigative records contemporaneous with the 2022 episode.",
          "why_it_matters": "It determines whether the most damning integrity evidence is directly proven or still partly inferential."
        }
      ],
      "reason": "The package is usable, but the strongest personal-benefit and retaliation evidence still depends on later reporting and partially authenticated material, so the direct personal-nexus question remains open enough to justify manual review."
